title: '`pallet-bounties`: Pay out only spendable funds'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Bounty and child-bounty payouts now only use funds the account can transfer, and a failed
    transfer makes the claim fail instead of being ignored.

    `pallet_bounties::Config` now requires the treasury `Currency` to also implement
    `fungible::Inspect` with the same balance type. `pallet-balances` already does, so runtimes
    using it need no changes.
crates:
- name: pallet-bounties
  bump: major
- name: pallet-child-bounties
  bump: minor
